{
    "title": "Mobs Maker for Minecraft PE",
    "description": "Mobs Maker Minecraft - Blockbench Toolkit to customizable player models Mobs professional! <b> Is inspired by Minecraft Addons Maker (MAM), Minecraft Mobs Maker would like to help you professionally make your own addons without coding, moving cubes, or drawing skills. \r\n\r\nWith <b>MCPE Mobs Maker for Minecraft</b> mobs creator can edit official mobs or make customizable player models based Mobs Maker Community\u2019s model. Editing Minecraft Mobs 2D/3D texture and skin or Editing professional behavior with JSON and exporting into Minecraft Game. \r\nEspecially now, Access the available list mob collection from our Minecraft community and share your own mobs with Commnunity.  \r\n\r\nFEATURE MINECRAFT MOB MAKER \r\n\u2714\ufe0f Support making customizable player models\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Custom animals/mobs, animation and edit JSON files easily\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Change texture and skin mobs with Blockbench\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Use 3D Model Editor or Blockbench professionally \r\n\u2714\ufe0f Customize and import Minecraft Mobs into your Minecraft\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Access rare Minecraft mobs collection   \r\n\u2714\ufe0f More ideas for making your Minecraft Addons PE \r\n\u2714\ufe0f Become Minecraft mobs editor/creator professionally\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Edit Minecraft Mobs with Block Bench as an experts\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Download thousands of hottest mods and addons in Minecraft Mods Maker: Ender Dragon, Golem, Wadren,.....\r\n\r\nBecome a Minecraft addons maker (MAM) with tons of unique models shared by users, players can now edit new mobs with Blockbench or MCPE 3D editor. Change some features such as custom/create Minecraft textures, models, or animation. You will get a lot of new mobs, then collect all of them into an addon and import them to the Minecraft Bedrock Edition game. \r\n\r\nAre you ready to create new models professionally with Block Bench? Mob Maker for Minecraft has integrated a lot of cool things that help you create customizable player models, format them, and create unique animation effects. Perfect!\r\n\r\n* NOTE: <b>MCPE Mobs Maker for Minecraft</b> is still developing, maybe it hasn't been completed. However, we will try to update more features: \r\n- Create mobs/mods with Minecraft 3D Editor / Blockbench\r\n- Edit animation - Improve the UI \r\n- Update data continuously and regularly.\r\n\r\nCheck our channels to learn how to use them and share your amazing mcaddon with everyone:\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Facebook: Addons Maker for Minecraft PE Community (MAM)\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Youtube: UltimateCraft\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Website: mcpeaddons.com\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Fanpage: AddOns Maker (MAM)\r\n\r\n<b>MCPE Mobs Maker for Minecraft</b> helps create mobs for Minecraft so easily with or without using Blockbench. Make your own addons for Minecraft with amazing features! Let's get started. \r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER \r\nThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition and is not affiliated with Mojang AB, its name, trademark and other aspects of the application are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance by http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines.</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mobs Maker Minecraft - Blockbench Toolkit to customizable player models Mobs professional! <b> Is inspired by Minecraft Addons Maker (MAM), Minecraft Mobs Maker would like to help you professionally make your own addons without coding, moving cubes, or drawing skills. <br><br>With <b>MCPE Mobs Maker for Minecraft</b> mobs creator can edit official mobs or make customizable player models based Mobs Maker Community\u2019s model. Editing Minecraft Mobs 2D/3D texture and skin or Editing professional behavior with JSON and exporting into Minecraft Game. <br>Especially now, Access the available list mob collection from our Minecraft community and share your own mobs with Commnunity.  <br><br>FEATURE MINECRAFT MOB MAKER <br>\u2714\ufe0f Support making customizable player models<br>\u2714\ufe0f Custom animals/mobs, animation and edit JSON files easily<br>\u2714\ufe0f Change texture and skin mobs with Blockbench<br>\u2714\ufe0f Use 3D Model Editor or Blockbench professionally <br>\u2714\ufe0f Customize and import Minecraft Mobs into your Minecraft<br>\u2714\ufe0f Access rare Minecraft mobs collection   <br>\u2714\ufe0f More ideas for making your Minecraft Addons PE <br>\u2714\ufe0f Become Minecraft mobs editor/creator professionally<br>\u2714\ufe0f Edit Minecraft Mobs with Block Bench as an experts<br>\u2714\ufe0f Download thousands of hottest mods and addons in Minecraft Mods Maker: Ender Dragon, Golem, Wadren,.....<br><br>Become a Minecraft addons maker (MAM) with tons of unique models shared by users, players can now edit new mobs with Blockbench or MCPE 3D editor. Change some features such as custom/create Minecraft textures, models, or animation. You will get a lot of new mobs, then collect all of them into an addon and import them to the Minecraft Bedrock Edition game. <br><br>Are you ready to create new models professionally with Block Bench? Mob Maker for Minecraft has integrated a lot of cool things that help you create customizable player models, format them, and create unique animation effects. Perfect!<br><br>* NOTE: <b>MCPE Mobs Maker for Minecraft</b> is still developing, maybe it hasn&#39;t been completed. However, we will try to update more features: <br>- Create mobs/mods with Minecraft 3D Editor / Blockbench<br>- Edit animation - Improve the UI <br>- Update data continuously and regularly.<br><br>Check our channels to learn how to use them and share your amazing mcaddon with everyone:<br>\ud83d\udc49 Facebook: Addons Maker for Minecraft PE Community (MAM)<br>\ud83d\udc49 Youtube: UltimateCraft<br>\ud83d\udc49 Website: mcpeaddons.com<br>\ud83d\udc49 Fanpage: AddOns Maker (MAM)<br><br><b>MCPE Mobs Maker for Minecraft</b> helps create mobs for Minecraft so easily with or without using Blockbench. Make your own addons for Minecraft with amazing features! Let&#39;s get started. <br><br>DISCLAIMER <br>This is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition and is not affiliated with Mojang AB, its name, trademark and other aspects of the application are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner. All rights reserved. In accordance by http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines.</b>",
